1
00:00:03,203 --> 00:00:05,127
This report lists calls.

2
00:00:05,127 --> 00:00:08,913
In the Data pane, under Calculated fields, click New.

3
00:00:09,365 --> 00:00:14,443
Enter a Label, such as Wait in minutes, and a Name that formulas will use:

4
00:00:14,443 --> 00:00:18,189
a letter first, then letters, digits and underscores.

5
00:00:18,189 --> 00:00:20,665
The name cannot be changed later.

6
00:00:21,154 --> 00:00:22,653
Write the Formula.

7
00:00:22,653 --> 00:00:28,021
Click a field in the Fields list, and it is written for you, in square brackets.

8
00:00:28,021 --> 00:00:29,894
Then divide it by sixty.

9
00:00:30,346 --> 00:00:31,445
Click Check.

10
00:00:31,445 --> 00:00:35,416
The builder shows the type of the result, or what is wrong.

11
00:00:35,416 --> 00:00:36,516
Click Apply.

12
00:00:36,966 --> 00:00:40,321
The new field is listed under Calculated fields.

13
00:00:40,321 --> 00:00:44,546
Drag it onto Columns, and the preview shows it for every call.

